然后将当前仅检查冲刺比例的逻辑替换为基于真实遥测的判定。以下片段可以作为验证器的核心门禁：

```csharp
private void CheckInfantryGaitCalibration(
    RtsUnit? infantry,
    in LocomotionTelemetry telemetry)
{
    if (infantry is null || !GodotObject.IsInstanceValid(infantry))
    {
